# Vite's dep-prebundle cache. Normally lives in node_modules/.vite, but Vite
# falls back to <root>/.vite when it can't resolve the project root (which
# happens after a self-restart on a vite.config.ts change) — either way it's
# a rebuildable cache, never source.
frontend/.vite/
